      notes: "Ninja Training generalizes House Robber to 3 choices per day. Key insight: dp[day][last] = best points on day 'day' if last activity was 'last'. We only need the previous day row, so compress to O(4) space. A 4th index (last=3 meaning 'no restriction') handles the final answer.",
